  problems/p01-ballistic/public/engine/trig.hpp.

See server/trace_engine/UPSTREAM.md for versions, hashes and the change list.

The sample trace under traces/samples/ embeds the grid of one public map
(public4-01) from the same problem package and records a match between that
package's public TIDE baseline bots and this repository's demo bot.

Not included in this repository: the P01 problem package itself (maps,
judge, baseline and challenge bot binaries) and any contestant or
model-generated bot submissions. Obtain the package separately; it remains
under its own license and notices.
